              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धीर — dhīr — \"fortitude; heart\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आईने धीर दिला म्हणून मी पुन्हा प्रयत्न केला. āīne dhīr dilā mhaṇūn mī punhā prayatna kelā. Mother gave me heart, so I tried again."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धीर (dhīr) देणे, to give someone heart; धीर (dhīr) धरणे, to be patient."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
