          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धीर (dhīr) is a tatsama, Sanskrit dhīra, \"wise; steady, resolute\"; CDIAL lists Marathi dhīr, \"patience\" (CDIAL 6817)."
            }
          ]
        },
