          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हायसे वाटणे (hāyse vāṭṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on हायसे, \"eased\", whose origin is not settled, with the verb वाटणे, \"to feel\"."
            }
